WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.190
Ndị nke m! Taa bụ akụkọ ihe mere eme!

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.750
Abụrụla m Papa — n'ezie!

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.750
Felix, biko — ọ bụ m bu ya ọnwa isii.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.250
Ntuli aka m meriri! Mmeri ukwu!

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.900
Mama, anyị nwere ozi… Ada dị ime! Ọnwa
isii!

6
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.240
Ọnwa isii? Ọ bụ taa ka unu na-agwa m?

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Mama, anyị chọrọ ibu ụzọ hụ na ihe niile
dị mma…

8
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.790
Ịhụ gịnị?

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.310
Na ọ bụ Felix nwe ime ahụ?

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.930
Mama! Ah-ah!

11
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.330
Nwanyị bịara ọhụrụ, lụrụ naanị nwa m nwoke
— afọ apụtala.

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.490
N'ime Lagos a, mmadụ ga-ajụrịrị.

13
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.910
Mama, a na m asọpụrụ gị.

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.430
Nwa a bụ nwa nwa gị.

15
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.450
Anyị ga-ahụ. DNA ga-ekwu.

16
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.500
Ezi m, o bughi ya n'obi… Mama bụ onye
ọchị.

17
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.120
Felix, ọ bụ naanị gị bụ onye ọchị n'ụlọ a.

18
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.810
Meow… Uche Mama na-enyo enyo.

19
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.610
Ọ dịghị onye ga-akparị nwa m.

20
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.430
Ọ dịghị onye. M ṅụrụ iyi.

21
00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.770
Felix, buru ibu m. Site taa, m ga-ebi ebe
a.

22
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.550
Onyenwe anyị ezitela ya… ka o lee anya.

23
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.600
Otú ahụ ka nsogbu ahụ si malite.
